<title>UK: GECC sets NZ$100 million two-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets NZ$100 million two-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$100 MLN   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    12.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  =	   PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
